<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Monthly GovTech Intelligence Brief - <%= client.business_name %></title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 40px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .brief-container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 36px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }
    .header {
      border-bottom: 3px solid #0369a1;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }
    .brand {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
    }
    .month-badge {
      background: #e0f2fe;
      color: #0369a1;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #0369a1;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding-bottom: 6px;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 16px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    th, td {
      padding: 10px;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      text-align: left;
    }
    th {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .metric-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .metric-box {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .metric-val {
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0284c7;
    }
    .metric-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #64748b;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="brief-container">
    <div class="header">
      <div>
        <div class="brand">J.E. ROCKER &bull; GOVTECH INTELLIGENCE DISPATCH</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:#64748b;margin-top:4px;">Monthly Commercial Deliverable &bull; $149/mo Active Subscription</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="month-badge"><%= month_year || 'October 2026' %></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h1>Monthly Procurement &amp; Market Intelligence Brief</h1>
    <p><strong>Prepared for:</strong> <%= client.business_name %> &bull; <strong>Attn:</strong> <%= client.owner_name %></p>
    <p><strong>Primary NAICS:</strong> <%= (client.naics_codes || []).join(', ') %> &bull; <strong>Target States:</strong> <%= (client.target_states || []).join(', ') %></p>

    <div class="metric-grid">
      <div class="metric-box">
        <div class="metric-val">63,711</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Total Solicitations Scanned</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <div class="metric-val"><%= matches ? matches.length : 18 %></div>
        <div class="metric-label">High-Density Target Matches</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-box">
        <div class="metric-val">$4.2M</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Pipeline Value Capacity</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>1. Top Solicitations &amp; Opportunities This Month</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Solicitation</th>
          <th>Agency</th>
          <th>Title</th>
          <th>Est. Value</th>
          <th>Deadline</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <% if (matches && matches.length) { %>
          <% matches.forEach(function(m) { %>
            <tr>
              <td><strong><%= m.solicitation_id %></strong></td>
              <td><%= m.agency %></td>
              <td><%= m.title %></td>
              <td><%= m.value %></td>
              <td><%= m.deadline %></td>
            </tr>
          <% }); %>
        <% } else { %>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>W9124D-26-R-0012</strong></td>
            <td>Dept of the Army</td>
            <td>Range Telemetry &amp; Base Infrastructure Modernization</td>
            <td>$1.8M</td>
            <td>30 Days</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>N00178-26-R-3001</strong></td>
            <td>Naval Sea Systems Command</td>
            <td>Autonomous Systems Software Testing &amp; Integration</td>
            <td>$2.4M</td>
            <td>45 Days</td>
          </tr>
        <% } %>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Modernization &amp; Agency Cycle Signals</h2>
    <p>• <strong>Fiscal Year Spending Trend:</strong> Priority small-business set-aside goal procurement windows are active across the Department of Veterans Affairs and Defense Logistics Agency.</p>
    <p>• <strong>State Level Opportunities:</strong> Rapid IT and infrastructure contracting surge detected in Arizona (AZ) and Texas (TX) procurement portals.</p>

    <h2>3. Recommended Action Plan</h2>
    <p>Submit capability briefings for top matching solicitations before pre-solicitation windows close. To activate dedicated RFP compliance matrix support, deploy the <em>GovTech Proposal Support</em> package ($399/proposal).</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
